hadiths[123]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par chhe haq hain: jab use milo to salam karo, jab woh tumhen bulaye to jawab do, jab woh tum se nasihat mange to nasihat karo, jab woh chheenke aur Allah ki hamd kare to us ka jawab do, jab woh beemar ho to iyadat karo, aur jab woh mar jae to us ke peeche jao. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ko dekho jo tum se neeche hai, aur use na dekho jo tum se upar hai; kyunke yeh ziyada laeq hai ke tum Allah ki nemat ko haqeer na samjho. Muttafaq alaih."
"1238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nawwas bin Sam'an (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se neki aur gunah ke bare mein poocha? To Aap ne farmaya: Neki husn akhlaq hai, aur gunah woh hai jo tumhare seene mein khatke aur tum napasand karo ke log us par muttali' hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do teesre ke baghair sargoshi na karen yahan tak ke logon se mil jao, kyunke yeh use ghamgin karta hai. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi aadmi ko us ki majlis se na uthae phir us mein baithe, lekin kushadgi karo aur wus'at karo. Muttafaq alaih."
"1241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khae to apna hath na ponchhe yahan tak ke use chaate ya chatae. Muttafaq alaih."
"1242","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chhota bade ko salam kare, chalne wala baithne wale ko, aur thode ziyada ko. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai: Aur sawar paidal ko."
"1243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jama'at ki taraf se kafi hai jab woh guzren ke un mein se ek salam kare, aur jama'at ki taraf se kafi hai ke un mein se ek jawab de. Ise Ahmad aur Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"1244","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahud aur Nasara ko salam mein pehal na karo; aur jab tum un se raste mein milo to unhen us ke tang hisse ki taraf karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1245","[AI-translation] Unhin se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke to kahe: Tamam hamd Allah ke liye hai; aur us ka bhai us se kahe: Allah tum par raham kare; phir jab woh us se kahe ke Allah tum par raham kare to kahe: Allah tumhen hidayat de aur tumhara haal durust kare. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1246","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi khade ho kar na piye. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1247","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi joota pahne to dayan se shuru kare, aur jab utare to baen se shuru kare; aur dayan pehle pahni jae aur aakhir mein utari jae. Ise Muslim ne baen tak nikala, aur baqi ko Malik, Tirmidhi aur Abu Dawud ne nikala."
"1248","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi ek jooti mein na chale; dono ko pahne ya dono ko utare. Muttafaq alaih."
"1249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us ki taraf nazar nahin karta jo apna kapda takabbur se ghaseete. Muttafaq alaih."
"1250","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khae to dayan se khae, aur jab piye to dayan se piye; kyunke shaitan baen se khata hai aur baen se peeta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1251","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khao, piyo, pahno aur sadqa karo baghair israaf aur takabbur ke. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Bukhari ne ise ta'liqan zikr kiya."
"1252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chahe ke us ke rizq mein kushadgi ki jae aur us ke nishan mein der ki jae to rishtedari milae. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qata' karne wala jannat mein dakhil na hoga, yani rishtedari katne wala. Muttafaq alaih."
"1254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tum par maaon ki nafarmani, betiyon ko zinda dafan karna, rokna aur mangna haram kiya hai; aur tumhare liye qeel qaal, kasrat sawal aur maal zaya karna napasand kiya hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki khushnudi walidain ki khushnudi mein hai, aur Allah ki narazi walidain ki narazi mein hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, banda mu'min nahin hota yahan tak ke apne padosi ya apne bhai ke liye woh pasand kare jo apne nafs ke liye pasand karta hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1257","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha ke kaun sa gunah bada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ke tum Allah ka shareek banao jabke Us ne tumhen paida kiya hai. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir ke tum apne bachche ko is khauf se qatl karo ke woh tumhare sath khaega. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo. Muttafaq alaih."
"1258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kabira gunahon mein se hai aadmi ka apne walidain ko bura kehna. Kaha gaya: Kya aadmi apne walidain ko bura kehta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Han, woh aadmi ke walid ko bura kehta hai to woh us ke walid ko bura kehta hai; aur us ki walidah ko bura kehta hai to woh us ki walidah ko bura kehta hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye halal nahin hai ke apne bhai se teen raaton se upar boycott kare: donon milen aur yeh munh phere aur woh munh phere; aur un donon mein behtar woh hai jo salam mein pehal kare. Muttafaq alaih."
"1260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har neki sadqa hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki mein se kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjho agarche apne bhai se khule chehre se milo."
"1262","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum shorba pakao to us ka pani ziyada karo aur apne padosiyon ki khabar lo. Dono ko Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mu'min se duniya ki takleefon mein se ek takleef door kare Allah us se qayamat ke din ki takleefon mein se ek takleef door karega; aur jo tangdast par aasani kare Allah us par duniya aur aakhirat mein aasani karega; aur jo Musalman ka parda rakhe Allah us ka duniya aur aakhirat mein parda rakhega; aur Allah bande ki madad mein hai jab tak banda apne bhai ki madad mein hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1264","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khair ki taraf rehnumai kare us ke liye karne wale ke ajr jaisa hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo tum se Allah ke naam se panah mange use panah do; aur jo tum se Allah ke naam se mange use do; aur jo tumhare paas neki lekar aae use badla do; phir agar na pao to us ke liye dua karo. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"1266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna jabke Nu'man ne apni do unglion se apne kanon ki taraf ishara kiya: Beshak halal wazeh hai aur beshak haram wazeh hai; aur un donon ke darmiyan mushtabah cheezen hain jinhen logon mein se aksar nahin jante; to jo shubhon se bache us ne apne deen aur izzat ko bacha liya; aur jo shubhon mein pada woh haram mein pada, jaise charwaha jo hima ke gird charae qareeb hai ke us mein pad jae; khabardar! Beshak har badshah ka hima hota hai; khabardar! Beshak Allah ka hima Us ki haram karda cheezen hain; khabardar! Beshak jism mein gosht ka tukda hai, jab woh durust ho to sara jism durust hota hai, aur jab woh bigad jae to sara jism bigad jata hai; khabardar! Woh dil hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dinar, dirham aur chadar ka banda halak ho; agar diya jae to razi ho, aur agar na diya jae to razi na ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera kandha pakda aur farmaya: Duniya mein goya ajnabi ya musafir bano. Aur Ibn Umar kehte the: Jab shaam karo to subah ka intezar na karo, aur jab subah karo to shaam ka intezar na karo; aur apni sehat se apni beemari ke liye lo, aur apni zindagi se apni maut ke liye. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi qaum se mushabahat kare woh unhi mein se hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke main ek din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche tha to Aap ne farmaya: Aey ladke! Allah ki hifazat karo woh tumhari hifazat karega; Allah ki hifazat karo use apne samne paoge; aur jab mango to Allah se mango, aur jab madad mango to Allah se madad mango. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur kaha: Hasan sahih hai."
"1271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe aise amal ki rehnumai karen ke jab main use karun to Allah mujh se mohabbat kare aur log mujh se mohabbat karen. To Aap ne farmaya: Duniya se be-raghbat ho Allah tum se mohabbat karega, aur jo logon ke paas hai us se be-raghbat ho log tum se mohabbat karenge. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad hasan hai."
"1272","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak Allah muttaqi, ghani, posheeda bande se mohabbat karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke Islam ke husn mein se hai us ka woh chhorna jo use ma'ni nahin rakhta. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur kaha: Hasan hai."
"1274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Adam ke bete ne pet se bura bartan nahin bhara. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise hasan kaha."
"1275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Adam ke sab bete khatakar hain, aur khatakaron mein behtareen tauba karne wale hain. Ise Tirmidhi aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad qawi hai."
"1276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khamoshi hikmat hai, aur us par amal karne wale thode hain. Ise Baihaqi ne Shu'ab mein za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; aur sahih kiya ke yeh Luqman Hakeem ke qaul se mauqoof hai."
"1277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad se bacho, kyunke hasad nekiyon ko khata hai jaise aag lakdi ko khati hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Majah ke han Anas ki hadees se isi tarah hai."
"1278","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehlwan kushti ladne wala nahin hai, pehlwan woh hai jo gusse ke waqt apne nafs ka malik ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"1279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zulm qayamat ke din andhere hain. Muttafaq alaih."
"1280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho, kyunke zulm qayamat ke din andhere hain; aur bukhl se bacho, kyunke us ne tum se pahle walon ko halak kiya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mahmud bin Labid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe tum par sab se ziyada khauf chhote shirk ka hai: riya. Ise Ahmad ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munafiq ki nishani teen hain: jab baat kare jhoot bole, jab wa'da kare khilaf kare, jab ameen banaya jae khayanat kare. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ke han Abdullah bin Amr ki hadees se hai: Aur jab jhagde to gali de."
"1283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ko bura kehna fisq hai, aur us se ladna kufr hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badgumani se bacho, kyunke badgumani sab se jhooti baat hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ma'qil bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo bhi banda jise Allah ra'iyat de, us din mare jab mare jabke woh apni ra'iyat se dhoka karne wala ho, to Allah us par jannat haram kar deta hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah! Jo meri ummat ke mamle mein se kisi ka wali bane aur us par sakhti kare to us par sakhti farma. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi lade to chehre se bache. Muttafaq alaih."
"1288","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe wasiyat karen. To Aap ne farmaya: Gussa na karo. Phir baar baar kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Gussa na karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khaulah Ansariyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak kuch aadmi Allah ke maal mein na-haq ghuste hain, to un ke liye qayamat ke din aag hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us mein jo woh apne Rabb se riwayat karte hain riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aey mere bando! Beshak main ne zulm ko apne nafs par haram kiya hai, aur use tumhare darmiyan haram banaya hai; to zulm na karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho gheebat kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ziyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara apne bhai ka us se zikr karna jo woh napasand kare. Kaha gaya: Batayen agar mere bhai mein woh ho jo main kehta hun? Aap ne farmaya: Agar us mein woh ho jo tum kehte ho to tum ne us ki gheebat ki, aur agar us mein na ho to tum ne us par bohtan lagaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1292","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad na karo, najsh na karo, bughz na rakho, peeth na phero, tum mein se koi kisi ki be' par be' na kare; aur Allah ke bando bhai bhai bano; Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, na us par zulm karta hai, na use ruswa karta hai, na use haqeer samajhta hai; taqwa yahan hai, aur apne seene ki taraf teen martaba ishara kiya; aadmi ke sharr ke liye kafi hai ke apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhe; Musalman ka har cheez Musalman par haram hai: us ka khoon, us ka maal aur us ki izzat. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1293","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qutbah bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah mujhe buri akhlaq, buri a'mal, buri khwahishat aur buri beemariyon se door rakh. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha aur alfaz unhi ke hain."
"1294","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai se jhagda na karo, us se mazaq na karo, us se wa'da na karo aur us ki khilaf-warzi karo. Ise Tirmidhi ne aisi sanad se riwayat kiya jis mein za'f hai."
"1295","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do khaslaten mu'min mein jama nahin hotin: bukhl aur bura akhlaq. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"1296","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gaali dene wale jo kahen woh pehal karne wale par hai jab tak mazloom hadd se na badhe. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1297","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sirmah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman ko nuqsan pahunchaye Allah use nuqsan pahunchayega, aur jo Musalman se sakhti kare Allah us par sakhti karega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"1298","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah fahsh behaya se bughz rakhta hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur ise sahih kaha."
"1299","[AI-translation] Aur unhi ke han Ibn Mas'ud ki marfoo' hadees se hai: Mu'min ta'na dene wala, la'nat karne wala, fahsh ya behaya nahin hota. Aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Daraqutni ne is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di."
"1300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura na kaho kyunke woh us ki taraf pahunch gae jo unhon ne aage bheja tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chugalkhor jannat mein dakhil na hoga. Muttafaq alaih."
"1302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna gussa roke Allah us se apna azab roke. Ise Tabarani ne Awsat mein riwayat kiya; aur is ka shahid Ibn Umar ki hadees se Ibn Abi Dunya ke han hai."
"1303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dhokebaz, kanjoos aur bura malik jannat mein dakhil na hoga. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur use do hadeeson mein juda kiya; aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"1304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum ki baat sunne ke liye kaan lagae jabke woh use napasand karte hon to qayamat ke din us ke kanon mein seesa dala jaega, yani sheesha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khushkhabri us ke liye jise us ka aib logon ke aebon se mashghool rakhe. Ise Bazzar ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1306","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne nafs mein badai kare aur apni chaal mein itrae woh Allah se is haal mein milega ke Woh us par ghazabnak hoga. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"1307","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jaldi shaitan se hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur kaha: Hasan hai."
"1308","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahusat bura akhlaq hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"1309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak la'nat karne wale qayamat ke din sifarishi aur gawah na honge. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ko gunah ka ta'na de woh us waqt tak na marega jab tak use na kare. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise hasan kaha; magar is ki sanad munqati' hai."
"1311","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bahz bin Hakim apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Halakat hai us ke liye jo baat kare aur jhoot bole taake us se qaum ko hansaen; us ke liye halakat hai, phir us ke liye halakat hai. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad qawi hai."
"1312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki tum ne gheebat ki ho us ka kaffara hai ke us ke liye istighfar karo. Ise Haris bin Abi Usamah ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke han aadmiyon mein sab se napasandeedah sakht jhagadne wala hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par sach lazim hai, kyunke sach neki ki taraf rehnumai karta hai, aur beshak neki jannat ki taraf rehnumai karti hai; aur aadmi hamesha sach bolta hai aur sach talash karta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke han siddiq likha jata hai; aur jhoot se bacho, kyunke jhoot burai ki taraf rehnumai karta hai, aur beshak burai aag ki taraf rehnumai karti hai; aur aadmi hamesha jhoot bolta hai aur jhoot talash karta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke han kazzab likha jata hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badgumani se bacho, kyunke badgumani sab se jhooti baat hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1316","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raston mein baithne se bacho. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamari majlison se hamara guzara nahin hai; ham un mein baat karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab tum inkar karte ho to raste ko us ka haq do. Unhon ne kaha: Aur us ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nigah neeche rakhna, takleef rokna, salam ka jawab dena, neki ka hukm dena aur burai se mana karna. Muttafaq alaih."
"1317","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis se Allah khair chahe use deen mein faqeeh bana de. Muttafaq alaih."
"1318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mizaan mein husn akhlaq se bhari koi cheez nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"1319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya iman mein se hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo logon ne pahli nubuwat ke kalaam se paya us mein se hai: Jab tum haya na karo to jo chaho karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqatwar mu'min Allah ko kamzor mu'min se behtar aur ziyada mahboob hai, aur har ek mein khair hai; us par hirs karo jo tumhen nafa de, Allah se madad mango, aajiz na ho; aur agar tumhen kuch pahunche to na kaho ke agar main karta to aisa aur aisa hota, lekin kaho ke Allah ne muqaddar kiya aur jo chaha kiya; kyunke agar shaitan ka kaam kholta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1322","[AI-translation] Hazrat Iyaz bin Himar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki hai ke aajizi karo yahan tak ke koi kisi par zulm na kare aur koi kisi par fakhr na kare. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1323","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki izzat ka peeth peeche difa kare Allah qayamat ke din us ke chehre se aag hataega. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur ise hasan kaha; aur Ahmad ke han Asma bint Yazid ki hadees se isi tarah hai."
"1324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa maal mein kami nahin karta, Allah bande ko mu'afi se siwae izzat ke nahin badhata, aur jo Allah ke liye aajizi kare Allah use buland karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey logo! Salam phailao, rishtedari milao, khana khilao, raat mein namaz padho jabke log soe hon; salamati se jannat mein dakhil hoge. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha."
"1326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tamim Dari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deen nasihat hai, teen martaba. Ham ne kaha: Kis ke liye Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Allah, Us ki kitab, Us ke Rasool, Musalmanon ke aimma aur aam logon ke liye. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein dakhil karne wali sab se ziyada Allah ka taqwa aur husn akhlaq hain. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1328","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum logon ko apne maalon se wus'at na doge, lekin unhen chehre ki kushadgi aur husn akhlaq wus'at denge. Ise Abu Ya'la ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1329","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'min mu'min ka aaina hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh mu'min jo logon se milta hai aur un ki takleef par sabr karta hai us se behtar hai jo logon se nahin milta aur un ki takleef par sabr nahin karta. Ise Ibn Majah ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya; aur yeh Tirmidhi ke han hai magar unhon ne sahabi ka naam na liya."
"1331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah! Jaise Tu ne meri soorat achchi banai hai, mere akhlaq achche farma. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke sath hun jab woh mujhe yaad kare aur mere liye us ke honth hilen. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur Bukhari ne ise ta'liqan zikr kiya."
"1333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Adam ke bete ne Allah ke azab se bachane wala Allah ke zikr se badh kar koi amal nahin kiya. Ise Ibn Abi Shaibah aur Tabarani ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1334","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum majlis mein baithe aur Allah ka zikr kare use farishte gher lete hain, unhen rahmat dhank leti hai, aur Allah unhen apne paas walon mein yaad karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1335","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum kisi jagah baithe aur Allah ka zikr na kare aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par salat na bheje woh qayamat ke din un par hasrat hogi. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur kaha: Hasan hai."
"1336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin... dus martaba, woh us ki tarah hai jis ne Aulad Ismail mein se chaar janen aazad kin. Muttafaq alaih."
"1337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sau martaba Subhanallah wa bihamdihi kahe us ki khatayen mita di jati hain agarche samandar ki jhag jaisi hon. Muttafaq alaih."
"1338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Juwairiyah bint Haris se riwayat hai ke mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhare baad chaar kalimaat kahe hain, agar unhen us se taula jae jo tum ne aaj se kaha hai to un se bhari honge: Allah ki tasbih Us ki hamd ke sath, Us ki makhlooq ki ginti, Us ke nafs ki khushnudi, Us ke arsh ka wazan aur Us ke kalimaat ki siyahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baqi rehne wali nekiyan hain: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah pak hai, Allah bada hai, tamam hamd Allah ke liye hai, aur Allah ke siwa na taqat hai na quwwat. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ko sab se mahboob kalaam chaar hain, tumhen nuqsan nahin dega ke tum ne un mein se kis se shuru kiya: Allah pak hai, tamam hamd Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Allah bada hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Abdullah bin Qais! Kya main tumhen jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazane ki rehnumai na karun? Allah ke siwa na taqat hai na quwwat. Muttafaq alaih; Nasai ne izafa kiya: Aur Allah se siwae Us ki taraf ke koi panah nahin hai."
"1342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak dua hi ibadat hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha; aur unhi ke han Anas ki hadees se is lafz se hai: Dua ibadat ka maghz hai. Aur unhi ke han Abu Hurairah ki marfoo' hadees se hai: Allah ke han dua se ziyada izzat wali koi cheez nahin hai. Aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan dua radd nahin hoti. Ise Nasai aur ghair ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur ghair ne ise sahih kaha."
"1344","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara Rabb haya wala kareem hai; woh apne bande se haya karta hai jab woh us ki taraf dono hath uthae ke unhen khali wapas kare. Ise Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1345","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab dua mein dono hath phailate to unhen wapas na karte yahan tak ke un se apna chehra ponchhte. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya; aur is ke shawahid hain jin mein se Ibn Abbas ki hadees Abu Dawud ke han hai. Aur un ka majmua taqaza karta hai ke yeh hasan hadees hai."
"1346","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din mujh se sab se qareeb woh hoga jo mujh par sab se ziyada salat bheje. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Shaddad bin Aws (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sayyid al-istighfar hai ke banda kahe: Aey Allah Tu mera Rabb hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tu ne mujhe paida kiya, aur main Tera banda hun; aur main Tere ahd aur wa'de par hun jitna ho sake; main Teri panah mangta hun us ke sharr se jo main ne kiya; main Tere samne Teri nemat ka iqrar karta hun jo mujh par hai, aur Tere samne apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun; to mujhe bakhsh de; kyunke gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yeh kalimaat na chhorte the jab shaam aur subah farmate: Aey Allah! Beshak main Tujh se apne deen, duniya, ghar walon aur maal mein afiyat mangta hun; Aey Allah mere pardon ko dhank de, mere khauf ko aman de, meri aage se, peeche se, dayan se, baen se, upar se hifazat farma; aur Teri azmat se panah mangta hun ke neeche se halak kiya jaun. Ise Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun Teri nemat ke zawal se, Teri afiyat ke badalne se, Teri achanak pakad se aur Tere tamam ghusse se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah! Beshak main Teri panah mangta hun qarz ke ghalbe se, dushman ke ghalbe se aur dushmanon ke ta'ne se. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko kehte suna: Aey Allah! Beshak main Tujh se mangta hun is sabab se ke main gawahi deta hun ke Tu hi Allah hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Akela, Be-niyaz, jis ne na jana na jana gaya, aur us ka koi humsfar nahin hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ne Allah se Us ke us naam se manga hai ke jab us se manga jae to deta hai, aur jab us se dua ki jae to qabool karta hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab subah farmate to kehte: Aey Allah Tere se ham ne subah ki, Tere se ham ne shaam ki, Tere se ham jeete hain, Tere se ham marte hain, aur Teri taraf uthna hai. Aur jab shaam farmate to isi tarah kehte siwae is ke ke farmate: Aur Teri taraf lotna hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya."
"1353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aksar dua thi: Aey hamare Rabb hamen duniya mein neki de, aakhirat mein neki de aur hamen aag ke azab se bacha. Muttafaq alaih."
"1354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua mangte: Aey Allah meri khatayen, meri jahalat, mere mamle mein meri ziyadti aur jo Tu mujh se ziyada janta hai bakhsh de; Aey Allah meri sanjeedgi, mazaq, khata, amd bakhsh de, aur yeh sab mere paas hai; Aey Allah jo main ne aage bheja, peeche rakha, chhupaya, zahir kiya aur jo Tu mujh se ziyada janta hai bakhsh de; Tu aage karne wala aur peeche karne wala hai, aur Tu har cheez par qadir hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah mere deen ko durust farma jo mere mamle ki hifazat hai; meri duniya ko durust farma jis mein meri guzran hai; meri aakhirat ko durust farma jis ki taraf mera lotna hai; zindagi ko mere liye har khair mein ziyadti bana; aur maut ko mere liye har sharr se rahat bana. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Aey Allah mujhe us se nafa de jo Tu ne mujhe sikhaya, mujhe sikha jo mujhe nafa de, aur mujhe nafa bakhshne wala ilm rizq de. Ise Nasai aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ke han Abu Hurairah ki hadees se isi tarah hai, aur aakhir mein farmaya: Aur mujhe ilm mein ziyadti de, tamam hal mein hamd Allah ke liye hai."
"1357","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen yeh dua sikhai: Aey Allah! Beshak main Tujh se har khair mangta hun, jald aur der, jo main ne jana aur jo main ne na jana; aur Teri panah mangta hun har sharr se, jald aur der, jo main ne jana aur jo main ne na jana; Aey Allah! Beshak main Tujh se us khair se mangta hun jo Tujh se Tere bande aur Nabi ne mangi, aur Teri panah mangta hun us sharr se jis se Tere bande aur Nabi ne panah mangi; Aey Allah! Beshak main Tujh se jannat mangta hun aur jo us ke qareeb kare qaul ya amal se, aur Teri panah mangta hun aag se aur jo us ke qareeb kare qaul ya amal se; aur Tujh se mangta hun ke har faisla jo Tu ne mere liye kiya hai khair banae. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1358","[AI-translation] Aur Shaikhain ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do kalimaat Rahman ko mahboob hain, zaban par halke hain, mizaan mein bhari hain: Allah ki tasbih Us ki hamd ke sath, Allah azeem ki tasbih."
